(Bug #72's guard: the key set is only the literal's while nothing can add
 to it. A `Set` puts "absent" in the map, so the read is NOT a miss - it
 answers the text that was set - and #54's rejection must still stand.)

a map called guess is {"a": "t"}.
Set guess's "absent" to "here".
a number called n is guess's "absent".
Print n.
